  "body": "Calling all serious renovators, builders, traders, and land bankers! If you live by the golden rule of real estate-LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION-this is the opportunity you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nWith potential to separate the property into 3 separate self-contained areas for rental or large families, there is massive value to be had here!\r\n\r\nLet's be upfront: This property is currently in uninhabitable condition and is not for the faint-hearted. With significant interior and exterior disrepair-including ceiling damage, extensive mould, damaged bathroom fittings, and weathered cladding and decking-it requires a comprehensive, top-to-bottom renovation or a complete fresh start. For buyers with vision, trade skills, and the drive to add serious value, the rewards in this blue-chip Browns Bay pocket are undeniable. \r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\nWhy this LOCATION is unbeatable!\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n* Top-Tier School Zones: \r\nThe ultimate drawcard for future resale or rental appeal. Zoned for the highly sought-after Rangitoto College, alongside Browns Bay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Effortless Transport Options: \r\nCommuting is a breeze with frequent bus routes nearby along East Coast Road and Beach Road, providing quick connections to the Northern Busway (Albany and Constellation Stations) for an easy trip to the Auckland CBD. Quick access to State Highway 1 via Greville Road or Oteha Valley Road keeps you connected to the wider North Shore.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Coastal Lifestyle & Amenities: \r\nJust minutes from the vibrant Browns Bay Village, offering an array of popular cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, and boutique shops. Enjoy weekend walks along Browns Bay Beach, sports and recreation at Freyberg Park, and major retail therapy at Westfield Albany just a short drive away.\r\n\r\n\r\nOpportunities to buy at an entry-level price point in the Rangitoto College zone and manufacture your own equity are increasingly rare. Bring your builder, your architect, and your imagination-this diamond in the rough is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nALL CONJUNCTIONALS WELCOME, so agents, bring your buyers! \r\n\r\nContact Ian 0211592078 today to find out more!",
